Files/Directories

/etc/dinit.d/ - user-installed dinit service files
/usr/lib/dinit.d/ - system dinit service files
/etc/dinit.d/config/ - configurations for dinit services
/etc/dinit.d/boot.d/ - dinit services that run on boot
